                "caption": "Figure 1:CritICL is a two-stage, inference-time W2SG method.Stage 1:Construct CritBank. We use SLMs to generate responses and reasoning on a dataset. Then we leverage a frontier LLM to produce critiques and assigns failure mode labels.Stage 2:Perform LLM inference with CritICL. For a given query, CritICL-static constructs model-specific failure mode profiles from CritBank, while CritICL-dynamic identifies failure modes relevant to the query. We then performs failure mode-based in-context sample selection from CritBank to provide in-context examples for target LLMs.",
